menu "Defuse32 game"

    config D32_TILT_DEG
        int "Tilt threshold (degrees from the orientation at arming)"
        range 5 90
        default 30
        help
            The game task polls the MPU-6050 every 100 ms while a round runs.
            A tilt above this angle (against the reference captured when the
            round was armed) is a strike, at most one per 5 s.

endmenu
